sers/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in v4.7.stable.official [5b4e0cb0f]\nNot reproducible in v4.6.2.stable.official [71f334935]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8088) - AMD Ryzen 9 7900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads) - 31.16 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nFor `RichTextLabel` node with center alignment, using a `FontVariant` with `spacing_glyph` will display an unexpected offset. \nFor `Label` node with same settings, the position is correct. \nThis bug appears after I upgrade Godot from 4.6 to 4.7. \n\nIn the screenshot, the upper one is `RichTextLabel` and the lower one is `Label`. \n<img width=\"1709\" height=\"575\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/13ed28cd-79ab-4590-9f8d-1d69df5d37d9\" />\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a `RichTextLabel`\n2. Set `Horizontal Alignment` to `Center`\n3. Set `Normal Font` in `Theme Overrides` with a new `FontVariation`\n4. Set `Glyph` of  `ExtraSpacing` to a non-zero value\n\nThen the displayed text will take an unexpected offset from the center position. \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[center_text_with_glyph_spacing.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30048938/center_text_with_glyph_spacing.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121405/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121405/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}